  "sourceContract": [
    "Only the actual validated keyboard observed menu creates opaque RendererRestoration. No JSON decoder or exposed constructor.",
    "Outputs captures before existing retirement, arms after existing ownerassignment and request supersession. The arm produces no focus/request/mutation and binds sameoutput/highergeneration/currentbinding/currentread.",
    "Original logical owner/incarnation/fingerprint is retained; current observed reply and new presentation encode the target. Replacement or missing root chooses only current declared eligible fallback.",
    "Incoming wrongscope/binding, stale generation/read or Unknown cannot focus. Existing invalidation and original explicit dismissal policy preserved.",
    "Controller draft and Unknown action reservations stay in existing model; no mutation resend/recovery/admission certificate."
  ],
  "nativeBoundaryRemaining": [
    "WebKit termination still exits host; this patch does not claim it delivers topology replacement.",
    "Mvp remains sole trusted generation authority; future actual renderer lifecycle callback must update it under same custody.",
    "No native/AT acceptance or current renderer recovery implementation claimed."
  ],
